    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:137",
      "class": "J",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_buy]",
      "text": "Well Sandy, the female camel, is a placid beast. At 20 years of age she comes from a prestigious line of camels - her mother was part of the Emir's baggage train!",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:138",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_buy]",
      "text": "Lumps, on the other hand, is a 15 year old male. He's a bit surly and prone to bouts of stubbornness. However, he more than makes up for this failing with his immense strength and stamina.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:139",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_buy]",
      "text": "Both of them are of the 'Camelus Horribleus' family, a rare breed only found in this area of Gielinor. It is...",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:140",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_buy]",
      "text": "Ok, ok, that's enough! They're camels, I get it.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:207",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_ali]",
      "text": "Have you considered hiring a camel? Or perhaps purchasing one of your own? I can get you a discount.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:228",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "Why? did they not please you?",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:229",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "No, they didn't. I sold them as Kebab meat!",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:229",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "I'm not really a camel person, so I gave them to a better owner.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:229",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "I decided to try and use them to end the hostilities between the two gangs.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:231",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "No, they didn't. I sold them as Kebab meat!",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:232",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "Nooooo! Not Sandy and Lumps! You beast! Get out of my shop this instant!",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:236",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "I'm not really a camel person, so I gave them to a better owner.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:237",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "That's very responsible of you. Too many people let their camels run feral through the desert, instead of sending them to happy homes.",
      "sharedWithRetainedOccurrence": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:238",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_disposed]",
      "text": "You want to watch out for those feral camels, you know.",
