      "occurrence": "feud_camel_man.rs2:255",
      "class": "O",
      "script": "[label,feud_camel_thanks]",
      "text": "Well I've been debating whether I should diversify into camel rental, too. Although I do have all these cages lying around... do you think there's a market for discount jackals?",
